{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:3.65.035","page_type":"section"},"citation":"3.65.035","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.65.035","content_hash":"19e4d05ce1e01176a8f3bc43e42ffb8d9ec5a3f31dfb3306619f1f2a839f9081","heading":"TTBID service fees.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.65.035:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.65.035","text":"(a) The service fee levied on all hotels in the District for calendar year 2026 shall be $1.00 per paid occupied room per night on hotel room rentals.\n(b) All revenue from the service fees shall be placed in a special fund, as required by K.S.A. 12-1792 and amendments thereto, and shall be used only for the services identified in TMC 3.65.020 . (Ord. 20618 § 1, 12-9-25.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"4d91cd8e-230a-5101-a027-1abd81732f06"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"3.65.035","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.65.035","content_hash":"b8064e1418821621534d3baa240f66ff40dab830f00cbf8c69f2d62bcfd41dcc","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.65.035:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.65.035:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.65.035","text":"(a) The service fee levied on all hotels in the District for calendar year 2026 shall be $1.00 per paid occupied room per night on hotel room rentals.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"83f2d34b-5d93-54c2-a7c8-88d3e1730588"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"3.65.035","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.65.035","content_hash":"1bb8bfa66cf21384e2